# Skills you build with this kit. Yours to keep or discard — they are not part of the kit,
# and committing them here would put your work in a tree that gets regenerated.
build/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local scratch
*.zip
manifest.json
.DS_Store

# Submission state. `submit_skill.py` now keeps both of these in a per-user state directory
# outside any working tree, so nothing should land here — these lines exist because a stale
# `.submit-confirm-*.json` was once swept into a commit and published, and a belt is cheap. The
# receipt matters more than the confirm file: it carries a retry secret, which is a credential.
.submit-confirm-*.json
*.receipt.json
